# review/12-duplicate-collector-positions
profile own
scope.begin caller async
future a new A bound
future b new B bound
collect.all results a b a
assert.items results @result:a @result:b @result:a
completions stream a a
completion.next first stream
await first_view first
use first_view
completion.next second stream
await second_view second
use second_view
check ''
scope.end caller
